# NASA cFE TBL (Table Services) command and telemetry packets: one whole Software Bus
# packet, CCSDS primary header, cFE secondary header and payload. Generated by
# tools/gen/cfe2pack.py from the default headers of nasa/cFE; do not edit by hand.
# Payload integers and floats are big-endian; pack.md states the layout rule.
